2. The note's words, option a, **byte for byte**: `This line is counted per site. Add a site with at least one device, or the quote cannot be priced.` (one line, ASCII, 98 characters, two sentences, a full stop after each). **This is the ONLY new user-facing sentence this change may add.** Any other new sentence, label, message, code, title or tooltip anywhere is a STOP (`CLARIFICATIONS.md:688`: every new customer-facing word comes to the product owner first).
